            replies: [
              { textOffset: 49, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
              { textOffset: 267, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
            ],
            textPool: "Hello!\u0000Who are you and what are you doing here?\u0000#0I'm delivering a package to Derrida.\u0000~0To Derrida?  Wait... No way...  You're a courier.  You must be out of your skull coming up here! ^1Must be really important, huh?  For you to risk your life like this, that is.\u0000#1Yeah...\u0000~1Well, don't let me stop you.  But you know, you might run into some pretty weird stuff. ^1You might have noticed that nobody around here is totally normal, that everybody is kinda unbalanced.  Well, there's a good chance that you might run into the king of the thrashed brains -- our very own CEO, the president of Genoq. ^1You see, our friend's mind has been skipping a few beats for the last couple of months.  Real paranoid, putting pictures of himself up on all the walls, thinks he's some kind of middle-east dictator or something.  ^1But now he's really snapped.  Sent a message to everybody -- 'We're under martial law.'  If I were you, I'd keep away from him.  This guy's more dangerous than a pit bull in a kindergarten. ^1Just a little helpful advice.\u0000",
          },
        },
      ],
