            replies: [
              { textOffset: 50, responses: [78, 85, 98, 107, 0, 0], nextTopics: [1, 2, 3, 4, 0, 0] },
              { textOffset: 116, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
            ],
            textPool: "At last!\u0000Thank you.\u0000Thank God they sent someone!\u0000Do you know anything about \u0000Genoq?\u0000DGeneration?\u0000Derrida?\u0000Barthes?\u0000What's your name?\u0000They cut the budgets on medical research, giving most R and D funds into the military side.  Two months ago, they started ignoring security measures, and began cranking out viruses, immunosupressives, and thousands of the Neogens.  They wanted to get more units out in time for the war.\u0000I really don't know anything about that.\u0000Yeah, they brought him in about a few years ago.  He gets along well here -- he doesn't have a conscience, neither do they.\u0000Barthes?  He's this ancient guy, barely alive.  Got really famous back in the 90's engineering these retroviruses that were meant to cure cancer.  The trouble was after a couple of hours, the patient's brain would hemorrhage.  He had some trouble finding a job on the open market.\u0000My name is Dennett.\u0000",
          },
